@startuml
title Record a settlement safely and query reports
start
:User selects group, payee, amount, payment date;
:Send payment command with session and idempotency key;
:Resolve authenticated debtor; authorize current membership\nor restricted own historical settlement;
if (Authorized and positive exact-scale amount?) then (yes)
  :Begin transaction; lock group ledger row;
  if (Matching command already committed?) then (yes)
    :Return prior recorded result;
  else (no)
    :Read current committed pairwise net debt\nfor this group and currency;
    if (Amount exceeds due or no positive debt?) then (yes)
      :Roll back; show current amount owed;
      stop
    else (no)
      :Save payment and negative journal settlement entry;
      :Save idempotent result;
      if (All writes succeed?) then (yes)
        :Commit atomically; release group lock;
      else (no)
        :Roll back; show unsuccessful action;
        stop
      endif
    endif
  endif
else (no)
  :Return authorization or field error;
  stop
endif
:Show new journal-derived pairwise balance;
:User requests expense / balance / payment report;
:Validate inclusive date range and supported parameters;
:Authorize records; read consistent database snapshot;
:Filter expenses by expense date and payments by payment date;\nlabel current balance or opening/movement/closing by posting date;
if (Any matching records?) then (yes)
  :Show separate summaries with authorized details;
else (no)
  :Show explicit no-matching-results state;
endif
stop
@enduml
